---
// Voices and Stories section for Life at Teknoppy with spotlight cursor cards and studio video preview
---

<section id="voices" style="padding-top:20px;scroll-margin-top:90px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center sec">
      <span class="tag">In their words</span>
      <h2 class="words">What is it like working at Teknoppy?</h2>
      <p>These stories about life at Teknoppy are written by the people named on them. We only edit for length.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Spotlight Story Cards -->
    <div class="stories">
      <!-- Story 1: Niya K K -->
      <div class="story rv" style="--d:0">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="story-av-wrap">
            <img src="/team/niya-kk.webp" alt="Niya K K" class="story-av-img" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <b>Niya K K</b>
            <span>SEO Lead · Vyttila Office</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <q>
          I joined Teknoppy as an SEO specialist and now lead our optimisation team. We set clear ranking priorities for each client before opening any tool, and every schema update is double-checked before it goes live. The best part is watching local businesses climb into the top three on Google and grow because of it.
        </q>
      </div>

      <!-- Story 2: Nandana S Madhu -->
      <div class="story rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="story-av-wrap">
            <img src="/team/nandana.webp" alt="Nandana S Madhu" class="story-av-img" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <b>Nandana S Madhu</b>
            <span>Web Developer · Vyttila Office</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <q>
          Building websites here is a shared job. Designers, developers and SEO specialists sit at the same table, so we catch slow pages and mobile layout issues before code ever reaches staging. I like shipping custom sites that pass Core Web Vitals on day one.
        </q>
      </div>

      <!-- Story 3: Farsana A -->
      <div class="story rv" style="--d:0">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="story-av-wrap">
            <img src="/team/farsana-a.webp" alt="Farsana A" class="story-av-img" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <b>Farsana A</b>
            <span>SEO & Content Analyst · Vyttila Office</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <q>
          I started on keyword audits and on-page metadata, with senior colleagues reviewing every submission side by side. Working directly on live client accounts in Kerala and the UAE has given me a real feel for search intent, benchmarking and structured data.
        </q>
      </div>

      <!-- Story 4: Vijayakala -->
      <div class="story rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="top">
          <div class="story-av-wrap">
            <img src="/team/vijayakala.webp" alt="Vijayakala, Business Development and Client Relations at Teknoppy" class="story-av-img" loading="lazy" style="object-position: top center;" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <b>Vijayakala</b>
            <span>Client Relations & Operations · Vyttila Office</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <q>
          Most of my day is spent talking to clients across Kerala, the UAE and Qatar. We never overpromise or hide problems. If an audit finds structural issues on an old site, we explain the fix clearly the same day. Clients value that honesty more than anything.
        </q>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Studio Video Row -->
    <div class="vrow">
      <div class="video rv" id="studioVideoWrap" role="region" aria-label="A morning at Teknoppy Studio">
        <video
          id="studioVideo"
          class="video-player"
          poster="/video/poster.jpg"
          preload="none"
          playsinline
          controls
        >
          <source src="/video/Teknoppy-Web-Banner.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <source src="/video/Teknoppy%20Web%20Banner%20final.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          Your browser does not support HTML5 video.
        </video>

        <div class="video-overlay" id="studioVideoOverlay">
          <button type="button" class="play" id="studioPlayBtn" aria-label="Play Studio Overview Video">
            <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <span class="vtitle">A morning inside our Vyttila studio</span>
          <span class="vmeta">Candid team moments & daily workflow</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="tscript rv" style="--d:1">
        <b>A morning at our Vyttila office</b>
        <p>Step inside our studio on the second floor of Kaithakal Building in Thykoodam, Vyttila. Our in-house team of designers, engineers, and search specialists collaborates under one roof.</p>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px">
          From the 9:30 am team sync to deep coding sessions and client calls for Kerala and GCC accounts, this is how 120+ websites came to life since 2018.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const video = document.getElementById('studioVideo');
  const overlay = document.getElementById('studioVideoOverlay');
  const playBtn = document.getElementById('studioPlayBtn');

  if (video && overlay) {
    function startVideo() {
      overlay.classList.add('is-hidden');
      video.play().catch(function(err) {
        console.warn('Playback error:', err);
        overlay.classList.remove('is-hidden');
      });
    }

    overlay.addEventListener('click', startVideo);
    if (playBtn) {
      playBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        e.stopPropagation();
        startVideo();
      });
    }

    video.addEventListener('ended', function() {
      overlay.classList.remove('is-hidden');
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .story-av-wrap {
    flex: none;
    width: 58px;
    height: 58px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid var(--tint-line);
    background: var(--tint);
  }
  .story-av-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    display: block;
  }
  .video-player {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    background: #0d0d0d;
  }
  .video-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(26,26,26,0.3) 0%, rgba(26,26,26,0.7) 100%);
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease, visibility 0.35s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .video-overlay.is-hidden {
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .play {
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    outline: none;
  }
  .vtitle {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #fff;
    background: rgba(26,26,26,0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .vmeta {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  }
</style>
